      },
      "id": "905d6584-250e-518e-83ff-a15e428b3097",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Make a sheet tab **Imported** whose headers match your CSV columns in lower_snake_case (for example `First Name` becomes `first_name`).\n2. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and the columns a row must have to be kept.\n3. Connect Google Sheets. Open the form URL from **CSV upload form** and upload a test file.\n4. Cleans: trims spaces, lower-cases emails and drops invalid ones, title-cases names, strips phone formatting, removes exact duplicates and rows missing required columns.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "b1b90fb6-8793-5083-b91a-9d9378dc8528",
